			</a>
		</div>
		<h1>warren yun</h1>
		<p>
			Hi. I like to make things and solve cool problems!
		</p>
		<p>For the past <span id="since">6 years</span>, I've found joy in writing software that other people use and benefit from. I've always found myself hopping from one interest to another (<span class="blue">web/app development</span>, <span class="blue">systems programming</span>, <span class="blue">mobile networking</span>.. blah blah), but my heart has always lived in <span class="green">autonomous robotics</span>, and more recently, <span class="green">machine learning</span>!
		</p>
		<p>
			I love meeting interesting people doing cool things! If you want to chat, please reach out at 
			<code class="email">wyun2006 [at] gmail [dot] com</code> ! Alternatively, you can probably find me somewhere in the paddocks of
			<span class="place">
